  "content": "<h1>由Coffee創建的經典風格PBR材質包</h1><h2>此材質包目前處於開發初期階段，目前涵蓋約300個方塊。</h2><p><strong>需求：</strong></p><p><strong><em>OptiFine或Iris光影模組</em></strong></p><p><em><strong>你需要確認你的光影是否支援LabPBR</strong></em></p><p><em><strong>支援PBR功能的光影包，例如Nostalgia Shaders、BSL Shaders或Kappa Shaders。</strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><em><strong>如果你喜歡我創建的材質包，可以考慮贊助我一杯飲料，以支持CoffeePBR材質包的長期更新。你可以在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fifdian.net%252fa%252fCoffeeXiaoGuan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">愛發電</a>上贊助我。</strong></em></h2><h1><em><strong>希望大家喜歡我的材質包</strong></em></h1><p><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8540790b-ece9-4836-8167-c4e958238f1a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_71ea77b4-ee21-4214-b413-2ee7b44ec729.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45bcbfd9-8ac1-4b3e-b687-89b1e6b628f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9f8eb26-8c3b-42cc-bec0-48cac661c730.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9560c0a3-b1c8-4d40-acba-2cda351e175f.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></em></p>",
